%description:
Tests a tail loss probe (RFC 8985 section 7, tlpEnabled=true) with new data,
which takes the place of the RTO. The tester deletes all ACKs of the first
flight. The fifth segment waits for cwnd. Without an RTT sample, the probe
timeout is the RTO, and the probe goes first (section 8). At t=4 the probe
sends the new segment 2001:2501, and the RTO starts again. The receiver
holds all data, so the ACK of 2501 ends the episode, and no RTO occurs.
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

network = inet.test.moduletest.lib.TcpTestNet1

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.testing=false

*.tcptester.script="b2 delete; b3 delete; b4 delete; b5 delete"

*.cli_app.active=true
*.cli_app.localAddress="10.0.0.1"
*.cli_app.localPort=1000
*.cli_app.connectAddress="10.0.0.2"
*.cli_app.connectPort=2000
*.cli_app.tOpen=0s
*.cli_app.tSend=-1s
*.cli_app.sendBytes=0B
*.cli_app.sendScript="1 2500"
*.cli_app.tClose=-1s

*.srv_app.active=false
*.srv_app.localAddress="10.0.0.2"
*.srv_app.localPort=2000
*.srv_app.connectAddress="10.0.0.1"
*.srv_app.connectPort=1000
*.srv_app.tOpen=0s
*.srv_app.tSend=-1s
*.srv_app.sendBytes=0B
*.srv_app.sendScript=""
*.srv_app.tClose=-1s

*.*_tcp.advertisedWindow = 5000
*.*_tcp.sackSupport = true
*.*_tcp.mss = 500
*.*_tcp.tcpAlgorithmClass = "TcpReno"
*.*_tcp.tlpEnabled = true
*.*_tcp.increasedIWEnabled = true



%contains: stdout
TLP: probing with 500 bytes of new data

%contains: stdout
[4.001 A007] A.1000 > B.2000: A 2001:2501(500) ack 501 win 5000

%contains: stdout
[4.003 B006] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 2501 win 5000

%not-contains: stdout
Performing retransmission
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
